WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:06.480
The superhero craze is showing no sign of slowing&nbsp;
down anytime soon, and it seems like the next&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:12.240
few years are filled to the brim with comic book&nbsp;
and superhero movies. But what's actually coming&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:17.360
out — and when? Here's everything you need to&nbsp;
know about these upcoming superhero movies.

00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:24.080
Sylvester Stallone appeared to retire his&nbsp;
iconic John Rambo character with 2019's Rambo:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:29.440
Last Blood, but the actor clearly isn't&nbsp;
planning on retiring himself anytime soon.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:29.440 --> 00:00:34.400
He'll go from action hero to&nbsp;
superhero in 2021's Samaritan,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:39.680
a film about a child who discovers the secret&nbsp;
behind a long-forgotten hero's disappearance.

00:00:39.680 --> 00:00:44.960
Samaritan is directed by Julius Avery, who&nbsp;
earned praise for helming the WWII zombie&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:44.960 --> 00:00:50.800
thriller Overlord in 2018. When he was offered the&nbsp;
chance to work with Stallone on his next feature,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:53.680
he jumped at it. Avery told Deadline:

00:00:53.680 --> 00:00:58.160
"Sly is a hero of mine. I'm incredibly&nbsp;
thrilled to be working with such an iconic&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:58.160 --> 00:01:02.720
actor on this very special project&nbsp;
with Balboa Productions and MGM."

00:01:02.720 --> 00:01:06.480
Avery reportedly struck up a great&nbsp;
relationship with Stallone on set,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:06.480 --> 00:01:11.280
who called him a "wonderful director" when&nbsp;
the movie wrapped in November 2020 — after&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:11.280 --> 00:01:16.800
a number of unfortunate coronavirus-related&nbsp;
delays. Stallone shared in an Instagram post:

00:01:16.800 --> 00:01:21.120
"Entire crew was tested down to the&nbsp;
last person every day for COVID which&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:21.120 --> 00:01:26.080
amounted to thousands upon thousands of&nbsp;
tests and we came through like champs."

00:01:26.080 --> 00:01:29.600
Samaritan is now due for&nbsp;
release on June 4th, 2021.

00:01:30.480 --> 00:01:36.080
After years of teasing, Marvel finally announced&nbsp;
that a standalone Black Widow movie was coming at&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:36.080 --> 00:01:42.400
Comic-Con 2019. By the end of the year we had our&nbsp;
first teaser for the film, a prequel that takes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:42.400 --> 00:01:48.240
place after the events of Captain America: Civil&nbsp;
War. The movie follows Natasha Romanoff as she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:48.240 --> 00:01:53.760
goes under the radar and returns to Russia, where&nbsp;
she reunites with her old friends and family.

00:01:53.760 --> 00:02:00.800
These new characters include Florence Pugh as&nbsp;
Yelena Belova, Rachel Weisz as Melina Vostokoff,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:00.800 --> 00:02:07.040
and David Harbour as Alexi Shostakov, a.k.a.&nbsp;
The Red Guardian. The movie also features&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:07.040 --> 00:02:13.040
a sinister new villain in Taskmaster, as well&nbsp;
as the return of William Hurt's Thaddeus Ross.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:13.040 --> 00:02:17.200
Black Widow has been subject to a whole&nbsp;
heap of controversy and speculation&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:17.200 --> 00:02:22.240
due to its numerous delays — as well as Disney's&nbsp;
apparent reluctance to release it on Disney+.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:23.200 --> 00:02:26.480
Now, though, the movie's status&nbsp;
has finally been confirmed.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:26.480 --> 00:02:32.880
Black Widow will hit theaters and Disney+&nbsp;
Premiere Access simultaneously on July 9th, 2021.

00:02:34.720 --> 00:02:40.960
One of the highlights of 2020's DC FanDome was&nbsp;
the roll call for James Gunn's The Suicide Squad,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:40.960 --> 00:02:46.320
which officially introduced the ensemble cast of&nbsp;
the soft reboot. A number of actors — including&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:46.320 --> 00:02:51.600
Margot Robbie and Viola Davis — reprise&nbsp;
their roles from 2016's Suicide Squad,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:51.600 --> 00:02:57.040
and will be joined by a host of new recruits, to&nbsp;
boot. Gunn is clearly pretty excited about his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:57.040 --> 00:03:02.320
anti-hero team-up flick, promising that it'll&nbsp;
be different to anything else he's ever made.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:02.320 --> 00:03:06.640
The featurette also revealed that plenty&nbsp;
of big action set-pieces are in store,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:06.640 --> 00:03:12.640
with producer Peter Safran describing The Suicide&nbsp;
Squad as kind of like a classic war movie.

00:03:12.640 --> 00:03:15.120
"This is a gritty 1970s war movie&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:15.840 --> 00:03:19.600
combined with the brilliance of&nbsp;
James Gunn's characters and comedy."

00:03:19.600 --> 00:03:24.160
A handful of other trailers were released&nbsp;
in early 2021, and they only seem to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:24.160 --> 00:03:29.040
further prove what the original featurette&nbsp;
suggested: that this is going to be one crazy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:29.040 --> 00:03:35.120
movie. The Suicide Squad will be released in&nbsp;
theaters and on HBO Max on August 6th, 2021.

00:03:36.240 --> 00:03:40.960
Above all else, Marvel's self-professed goal&nbsp;
for Shang-Chi and the Legend of the Ten Rings&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:40.960 --> 00:03:46.080
is to offer their own perspective on Asian&nbsp;
identity. The studio has hired Asian and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:46.080 --> 00:03:51.040
Asian American filmmakers to make sure that&nbsp;
happens, and, judging by the character's history,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:51.040 --> 00:03:56.400
that's a pretty smart move. The Hands of&nbsp;
Shang-Chi: Master of Kung Fu comics began as&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:56.400 --> 00:04:02.080
an unofficial continuation of Bruce Lee's legacy,&nbsp;
and while Marvel's intentions may have been noble,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:02.640 --> 00:04:08.160
the execution wasn't always perfect — making&nbsp;
controversial pulp villain Fu Manchu Shang-Chi's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:08.160 --> 00:04:12.960
father was undoubtedly a bad move, for example,&nbsp;
and one that's quite rightly been retconned.

00:04:13.520 --> 00:04:18.560
The job of bringing Shang-Chi into the modern&nbsp;
age belongs to Chinese American screenwriter&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:18.560 --> 00:04:23.920
Dave Callaham and Japanese Hawaiian director&nbsp;
Destin Daniel Cretton. The titular role,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:23.920 --> 00:04:30.480
meanwhile, has gone to Chinese Canadian actor&nbsp;
Simu Liu. At Comic-Con 2019, Lieu revealed:

00:04:30.480 --> 00:04:33.600
"I was cast on Tuesday. I screen-tested on Sunday&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:33.600 --> 00:04:36.560
in New York. This is the&nbsp;
craziest, craziest dream."

00:04:36.560 --> 00:04:40.480
The actor, who is perhaps best known for&nbsp;
the comedy series Fresh Off the Boat,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:40.480 --> 00:04:45.760
told a packed Hall H that his parents moved to&nbsp;
North America with next to nothing. He said:

00:04:45.760 --> 00:04:48.160
"All I've ever wanted was to make them proud."

00:04:48.160 --> 00:04:52.960
Shang-Chi also features Tony Leung as&nbsp;
the villainous Mandarin and Awkwafina&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:52.960 --> 00:04:58.320
as Shang-Chi’s best friend. The movie&nbsp;
hits theaters on September 3rd, 2021.

00:04:59.040 --> 00:05:04.080
In June 2019, Amy Pascal confirmed&nbsp;
that Venom star Tom Hardy would be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:04.080 --> 00:05:08.880
reprising the role of Eddie Brock in an&nbsp;
interview with Fandango. The producer said:

00:05:08.880 --> 00:05:13.200
"Tom Hardy will be back, magnificently&nbsp;
playing that character as no one else can."

00:05:13.760 --> 00:05:17.520
Pascal made no mention of Venom&nbsp;
director Ruben Fleischer, however.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:17.520 --> 00:05:22.320
As it turned out, Fleishcer would not be&nbsp;
returning. Instead, Hardy later confirmed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:22.320 --> 00:05:26.880
that actor and director Andy Serkis would&nbsp;
be taking the reins for the Venom sequel.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:26.880 --> 00:05:32.320
Serkis made his directorial debut in 2017&nbsp;
with heartwarming drama Breathe and proved&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:32.320 --> 00:05:36.880
his blockbuster chops the following&nbsp;
year with Mowgli: Legend of the Jungle.

00:05:36.880 --> 00:05:41.200
Venom's mid-credits scene made it pretty&nbsp;
clear that Sony was plotting a sequel.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:41.200 --> 00:05:45.440
It follows Brock as he visits Woody&nbsp;
Harrelson's Cletus Kasady in prison.

00:05:45.440 --> 00:05:52.240
"When I get outta here, and I&nbsp;
will, there's gonna be carnage."

00:05:53.280 --> 00:05:55.360
Just what form will that carnage take?&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:55.360 --> 00:05:59.760
You can probably guess — but if you want&nbsp;
to know for sure, you'll need to see Venom:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:59.760 --> 00:06:04.600
Let There Be Carnage. The movie arrives&nbsp;
in theaters on September 24th, 2021.

00:06:05.600 --> 00:06:10.960
Due to the coronavirus pandemic, Marvel's&nbsp;
Eternals has been bumped to the end of 2021.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:11.520 --> 00:06:16.480
Luckily, fans have already been given a few&nbsp;
hints and teasers about the barrier-breaking&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:16.480 --> 00:06:22.640
cosmic blockbuster. The film will apparently take&nbsp;
place over a period of 7,000 years, according to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:22.640 --> 00:06:27.520
Kevin Feige, and will follow the exploits of&nbsp;
the eponymous immortals known as the Eternals.

00:06:27.520 --> 00:06:31.840
The impressive ensemble cast&nbsp;
includes Angelina Jolie as Thena,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:31.840 --> 00:06:36.800
Richard Madden as Ikaris, and Kit Harington&nbsp;
as the Black Knight, Dane Whitman.

00:06:36.800 --> 00:06:40.560
Meanwhile, Gemma Chan will&nbsp;
appear as the human-loving Sersi,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:40.560 --> 00:06:47.200
Kumail Nanjiani is playing Kingo, Lauren Ridloff&nbsp;
is Makkari, Brian Tyree Henry is Phastos,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:47.200 --> 00:06:52.640
Lia McHugh is Sprite, Don Lee is&nbsp;
Gilgamesh, Barry Keoghan is Druig,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:52.640 --> 00:06:58.640
and Salma Hayek is Ajak, "leader" of the group.&nbsp;
Sound like a lot? That's comic books,for you.

00:06:58.640 --> 00:07:03.120
MCU overlord Kevin Feige has also&nbsp;
confirmed that Eternals will feature&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:03.120 --> 00:07:09.120
the MCU's first openly gay characters. Actor&nbsp;
Haaz Sleiman later told Entertainment Weekly:

00:07:09.120 --> 00:07:13.840
"I'm married to the gay superhero Phastos,&nbsp;
played by Atlanta's Brian Tyree Henry,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:13.840 --> 00:07:16.560
and we represent a gay family and have a child."

00:07:16.560 --> 00:07:22.560
Marvel's first deaf superhero, Makkari, will also&nbsp;
debut, making this the most representative MCU&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:22.560 --> 00:07:27.920
movie to date. According to a leaked tie-in&nbsp;
toy, the villain of the picture will be Kro,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:27.920 --> 00:07:31.360
a powerful member of the hideous&nbsp;
species known as the Deviants.

00:07:31.360 --> 00:07:36.400
Nomadland director and Oscar frontrunner&nbsp;
Chloe Zhao directs from a script by Matthew&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:36.400 --> 00:07:40.640
and Ryan Firpo. Eternals will be&nbsp;
released on November 5th, 2021.

00:07:41.600 --> 00:07:46.720
Over the last few months, news on the upcoming&nbsp;
Spider-Man has continued to trickle through.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:46.720 --> 00:07:51.120
Some of the most tantalizing tidbits about&nbsp;
the movie, titled Spider-Man: No Way Home,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:51.120 --> 00:07:55.360
include the fact that Jamie Foxx and&nbsp;
Alfred Molina are both returning to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:55.360 --> 00:08:00.160
Marvel as Electro and Doctor Octopus&nbsp;
respectively. In October 2020,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:00.160 --> 00:08:05.040
The Hollywood Reporter's sources revealed that&nbsp;
Foxx's character from the Andrew Garfield movies&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:05.040 --> 00:08:11.040
was set for a shock return in October 2020, and&nbsp;
a few months later they revealed that Molina,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:11.040 --> 00:08:15.920
who went toe-to-toe with Toby Maguire's&nbsp;
Spidey, is also going to feature in the movie.

00:08:15.920 --> 00:08:17.440
"Where do all these guys come from?"

00:08:18.320 --> 00:08:22.400
Foxx himself later hinted at Garfield&nbsp;
and Maguire reprising their roles in a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:22.400 --> 00:08:27.520
hastily-deleted Instagram post, and there's been&nbsp;
talk of Emma Stone and Kirsten Dunst coming back,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:27.520 --> 00:08:31.440
too. Three generations of Spider-Man&nbsp;
movies could allegedly collide in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:31.440 --> 00:08:35.840
this highly anticipated threequel…&nbsp;
but how is this actually possible?

00:08:35.840 --> 00:08:40.080
Well, Sony has been embracing the idea&nbsp;
of a shared multiverse with its animated&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:40.080 --> 00:08:45.360
Spider-Verse franchise, and we know the concept&nbsp;
will play a big part in upcoming MCU projects,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:45.360 --> 00:08:50.720
most notably culminating with Doctor Strange in&nbsp;
the Multiverse of Madness. Fittingly, Benedict&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:50.720 --> 00:08:56.160
Cumberbatch's Stephen Strange will reportedly play&nbsp;
a supporting role in Holland's third solo film,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:56.160 --> 00:09:02.200
taking over as Peter Parker's mentor. The movie&nbsp;
swings into theaters on December 17th, 2021.

00:09:03.200 --> 00:09:07.440
Sony dropped the first trailer&nbsp;
for Morbius in January 2020,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:07.440 --> 00:09:12.800
and it was met with a mixture of confusion and&nbsp;
excitement. The three-minute clip was essentially&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:12.800 --> 00:09:17.840
a mini-origin story for lesser-known&nbsp;
Marvel antihero Dr. Michael Morbius,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:17.840 --> 00:09:22.880
a brilliant scientist who turns to vampirism&nbsp;
after his attempts to cure his rare blood&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:22.880 --> 00:09:28.880
disease have mixed results. Morbius debuted&nbsp;
as an enemy of Peter Parker in 1971's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:28.880 --> 00:09:34.480
Amazing Spider-Man #101, but became more&nbsp;
of a sympathetic figure in later issues.

00:09:34.480 --> 00:09:39.440
While this movie is very much part of Sony's&nbsp;
own universe of Marvel characters, the Morbius&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:39.440 --> 00:09:44.240
teaser contained a few easter eggs that raised&nbsp;
questions about the film's relationship to the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:44.240 --> 00:09:50.880
MCU. For example, the word "murderer" has been&nbsp;
graffitied across an image of Spidey in one scene,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:50.880 --> 00:09:54.160
indicating that this is Tom&nbsp;
Holland's version of the character,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:54.160 --> 00:09:57.680
who was framed by Mysterio&nbsp;
in Spider-Man: Far From Home.

00:09:57.680 --> 00:10:03.360
If that wasn't enough, Michael Keaton shows up&nbsp;
as Adrian Toomes, confirming that Morbius is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:03.360 --> 00:10:08.080
tied to the MCU in some way or another.&nbsp;
As such, some fans are predicting that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:08.080 --> 00:10:13.680
Morbius might sow the seeds for a big screen&nbsp;
Sinister Six — but just what form that movie&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:13.680 --> 00:10:20.480
might take in Sony's universe has yet to be seen.&nbsp;
Morbius will be released on January 21st, 2022.

00:10:21.756 --> 00:10:26.880
The first trailer for Robert Pattinson's&nbsp;
upcoming Batman movie dropped during DC FanDome,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:26.880 --> 00:10:32.320
revealing plot details, first looks at villains,&nbsp;
and the darkest big screen version of the Caped&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:32.320 --> 00:10:37.920
Crusader yet. Pattinson's stripped-down Batsuit&nbsp;
is on full display in the trailer, including&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:37.920 --> 00:10:45.840
a particularly shocking scene in which he&nbsp;
straight-up lays into an unfortunate gang member.

00:10:49.680 --> 00:10:50.560
"I'm vengeance."

00:10:51.120 --> 00:10:56.080
What's immediately clear from the footage is&nbsp;
that The Batman will be unlike any Bat-film&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:56.080 --> 00:11:00.000
that's come before it, and not just&nbsp;
in terms of grit and violence — since&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:03.680
writer-director Matt Reeves is going&nbsp;
back to the Dark Knight's early days.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:04.240 --> 00:11:09.760
During the FanDome panel, Reeves revealed that&nbsp;
Pattinson's Bruce Wayne is in "Year 2" of his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:09.760 --> 00:11:14.960
Batman career, referencing the famous late&nbsp;
'80s arc of the same name. The first trailer&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:14.960 --> 00:11:19.600
also offered up a glimpse of Zoë Kravitz&nbsp;
as Catwoman and Colin Farrell's Penguin,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:19.600 --> 00:11:23.600
but it's also clear that Paul Dano's&nbsp;
Riddler will be the movie's main threat.

00:11:24.240 --> 00:11:28.080
Having been delayed a number of times&nbsp;
due to the coronavirus pandemic,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:28.080 --> 00:11:32.080
The Batman will now arrive in&nbsp;
theaters on March 4th, 2022.

00:11:33.200 --> 00:11:38.320
When Doctor Strange in the Multiverse of&nbsp;
Madness was announced at Comic-Con 2019,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:38.320 --> 00:11:43.920
returning director Scott Derrickson claimed&nbsp;
it would be the first properly scary MCU film.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:43.920 --> 00:11:48.960
Kevin Feige, however, was quick to downplay the&nbsp;
idea. Then, during an appearance at the New York&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:48.960 --> 00:11:53.840
Film Academy, Marvel's president said that he&nbsp;
"wouldn't necessarily" call it a horror in the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:53.840 --> 00:11:59.280
traditional sense. Derrickson exited the project&nbsp;
over creative differences a few weeks later.

00:11:59.280 --> 00:12:04.080
Marvel wasted no time in finding a replacement,&nbsp;
and their apparent choice has gone down pretty&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:04.080 --> 00:12:09.120
well with fans. Veteran horror director&nbsp;
Sam Raimi began talking to the studio&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:09.120 --> 00:12:14.560
about the project in February 2020, and was soon&nbsp;
brought on to the project properly. Derrickson,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:14.560 --> 00:12:18.720
for his part, called Raimi's hiring&nbsp;
a "great choice" on Marvel's part.

00:12:18.720 --> 00:12:23.120
Raimi, whose Spider-Man movies laid the&nbsp;
foundation for the modern superhero film,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:23.120 --> 00:12:27.120
remains a fan favorite director in the&nbsp;
comic book world, and will likely bring&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:27.120 --> 00:12:31.840
some prestige to Benedict Cumberbatch's second&nbsp;
solo outing as Stephen Strange. They'll be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:31.840 --> 00:12:37.040
working from a script by Michael Waldron, the&nbsp;
head writer of upcoming Disney+ series, Loki.

00:12:37.040 --> 00:12:40.240
A couple of new MCU characters will&nbsp;
make their debuts in the movie,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:40.240 --> 00:12:45.520
with some sources suggesting that the story will&nbsp;
introduce the iconic Marvel characters Clea and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:45.520 --> 00:12:50.960
Brother Voodoo. But you can expect plenty of&nbsp;
familiar faces to appear, too. Elizabeth Olsen's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:50.960 --> 00:12:56.240
Scarlet Witch is going to feature prominently in&nbsp;
the movie, while Chiwetel Ejiofor, Benedict Wong,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:56.240 --> 00:13:02.320
and Rachel McAdams are also expected to&nbsp;
return. The madness begins on March 25th, 2022.

00:13:03.280 --> 00:13:08.320
News that Chris Hemsworth and Taika Waititi&nbsp;
were teaming up for another Thor movie broke&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:08.320 --> 00:13:13.920
days before Comic-Con 2019, but the biggest&nbsp;
announcement came at the event itself — that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:13.920 --> 00:13:16.560
Natalie Portman is returning to the franchise.

00:13:16.560 --> 00:13:21.760
The Oscar winner portrayed Thor's earthbound&nbsp;
love interest Jane Foster in 2011's Thor&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:21.760 --> 00:13:26.160
and 2013's Thor: The Dark World,&nbsp;
but was absent for 2017's Thor:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:26.160 --> 00:13:30.320
Ragnarok, with an explanation briefly&nbsp;
given that the pair had broken up.

00:13:30.320 --> 00:13:34.240
"She didn't dump me, you know. I&nbsp;
dumped her. It was a mutual dumping."

00:13:34.880 --> 00:13:38.000
After that, Portman appeared to&nbsp;
be done with Marvel — but her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:38.000 --> 00:13:42.960
character in the Marvel comics has developed&nbsp;
significantly since her last film appearance.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:42.960 --> 00:13:48.000
Most notably, in a 2014 story, Foster&nbsp;
was deemed worthy to wield Thor's hammer,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:48.000 --> 00:13:52.480
and adopted the title Goddess of Thunder. We&nbsp;
don't know how this will all play out on screen,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:52.480 --> 00:13:56.960
but Waititi clearly has big plans&nbsp;
for both Portman and Jane Foster.

00:13:56.960 --> 00:14:00.560
Aside from that, the director has&nbsp;
been tight-lipped on plot details,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:00.560 --> 00:14:05.520
but he at least dropped a few tantalizing teases&nbsp;
during an April 2020 watch party for Thor:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:05.520 --> 00:14:10.800
Ragnarok. Waititi revealed that he intends to&nbsp;
introduce starsharks to the MCU, for example,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:10.800 --> 00:14:14.640
and also left the door open&nbsp;
for a possible Loki return.

00:14:14.640 --> 00:14:15.840
"Surprise."

00:14:16.720 --> 00:14:21.760
It's also been confirmed that the movie's main&nbsp;
villain, Gorr the God Butcher, will be played by&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:21.760 --> 00:14:27.520
MCU debutant Christian Bale. Meanwhile, Tessa&nbsp;
Thompson will be back in action as Valkyrie,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:27.520 --> 00:14:31.120
and the Guardians of the Galaxy&nbsp;
are also set to make an appearance.

00:14:31.120 --> 00:14:36.800
Perhaps strangest of all, however, is the news&nbsp;
that the Asgardian actors from Ragnarok are also&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:36.800 --> 00:14:41.920
returning for the movie. This time around,&nbsp;
Luke Hemsworth, Matt Damon and Sam Neill&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:41.920 --> 00:14:46.320
are joined by Melissa McCarthy, who&nbsp;
is playing the stage version of Hela.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:46.320 --> 00:14:51.760
Wanna know what that's all about? Find out when&nbsp;
Love and Thunder is released on May 6th, 2022.

00:14:52.640 --> 00:14:56.400
The planned sequel to the smash hit&nbsp;
Black Panther suffered a massive blow&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:56.400 --> 00:15:01.280
in August 2020 with the heartbreaking&nbsp;
and untimely loss of Chadwick Boseman.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:01.280 --> 00:15:06.400
The actor was diagnosed with colon cancer in&nbsp;
2016, the year he made the first of his four&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:06.400 --> 00:15:10.880
appearances as the African superhero. For&nbsp;
a number of reasons, Boseman chose to keep&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:10.880 --> 00:15:16.000
his diagnosis private — even from Marvel and&nbsp;
filmmaker Ryan Coogler. Coogler later said:

00:15:16.000 --> 00:15:19.920
"I spent the last year preparing,&nbsp;
imagining and writing words for him to say,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:19.920 --> 00:15:24.080
that we weren't destined to see. It leaves me&nbsp;
broken knowing that I won't be able to watch&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:24.080 --> 00:15:28.960
another close-up of him in the monitor again&nbsp;
or walk up to him and ask for another take."

00:15:28.960 --> 00:15:32.640
Boseman's death was reportedly&nbsp;
devastating for everyone at Disney,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:32.640 --> 00:15:37.360
but conversations about where the franchise&nbsp;
should go have now begun behind the scenes.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:37.360 --> 00:15:40.640
Marvel has made it clear they have&nbsp;
no intention of recasting the role,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:40.640 --> 00:15:44.480
so that means the Black Panther mantle&nbsp;
is likely to be handed over to a new&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:44.480 --> 00:15:49.120
character earlier than expected — something&nbsp;
there's actually a well-known precedent for.

00:15:49.120 --> 00:15:53.200
In the comics, T'Challa's younger&nbsp;
half-sister Shuri has her Black Panther&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:53.200 --> 00:15:57.760
training fast-tracked after he is severely&nbsp;
injured by villains loyal to Namor — who,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:57.760 --> 00:16:02.960
as it happens, has been rumored to appear as&nbsp;
the sequel's big bad. But whether it's Shuri,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:02.960 --> 00:16:08.080
another of T'Challa's allies, or a brand new&nbsp;
character altogether, whoever takes on the mantle&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:08.080 --> 00:16:14.080
of Black Panther will have some very big shoes&nbsp;
to fill. We'll see how they do on July 8th, 2022.

00:16:14.960 --> 00:16:20.160
Dwayne Johnson has been touting a Black Adam&nbsp;
movie for well over a decade. He became officially&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:20.160 --> 00:16:25.600
attached to play the character in 2014, and was&nbsp;
originally supposed to debut as Adam in Shazam!.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:25.600 --> 00:16:31.600
But in 2017, execs decided the character was too&nbsp;
big for a supporting role, and needed his own solo&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:31.600 --> 00:16:37.120
movie instead. News has been painfully slow since&nbsp;
then, but things picked up a little during DC's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:37.120 --> 00:16:42.720
FanDome event in summer 2020. There wasn't any&nbsp;
actual footage to show, but Johnson nevertheless&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:42.720 --> 00:16:49.120
debuted a brief teaser made up of stills created&nbsp;
by DC's Jim Lee and Instagram artist BossLogic.

00:16:49.120 --> 00:16:54.240
Johnson narrates the teaser in character,&nbsp;
explaining that he was imprisoned some 5,000 years&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:54.240 --> 00:17:00.160
earlier when his home, the fictional nation of&nbsp;
Kahndaq, was a "melting pot of magic and powers."&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:00.160 --> 00:17:05.040
In the comics, Adam is a vengeful slave who's&nbsp;
granted the gifts of the wizard Shazam and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:05.040 --> 00:17:11.040
uses them for good — before eventually being led&nbsp;
astray. Johnson confirmed that the Justice Society&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:11.040 --> 00:17:16.800
of America will feature in the film, and we now&nbsp;
know who's playing them. Aldis Hodge is Hawkman,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:16.800 --> 00:17:22.720
Noah Centineo is Atom Smasher, Quintessa&nbsp;
Swindell is Cyclone, and — rounding out&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:22.720 --> 00:17:29.040
the main cast with his superhero movie debut –&nbsp;
Pierce Brosnan is Dr. Fate. Rising star Bodhi&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:29.040 --> 00:17:34.160
Sabongui will also reportedly be showing&nbsp;
up as a "key" yet "secret" character.

00:17:34.160 --> 00:17:39.040
Jaume Collet-Serra, who directed Johnson in&nbsp;
Disney's Jungle Cruise, is working from a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:39.040 --> 00:17:44.960
script by Adam Sztykiel, who wrote the former&nbsp;
wrestler's 2018 actioner, Rampage. Filming on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:44.960 --> 00:17:51.680
Black Adam began in April 2021, with the movie&nbsp;
itself set for a July 29th, 2022 release date.

00:17:52.320 --> 00:17:57.520
The sequel to 2018's Spider-Man: Into the&nbsp;
Spider-Verse was already in the works by the time&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:57.520 --> 00:18:02.400
the original movie hit theaters. Given how long&nbsp;
the first movie took to complete, however, that's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:02.400 --> 00:18:07.360
not at all surprising. Into the Spider-Verse was&nbsp;
four years in the making — which made fans all&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:07.360 --> 00:18:12.080
the more worried about potential delays to the&nbsp;
project when the coronavirus pandemic struck.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:12.080 --> 00:18:17.040
Thankfully, the movie's schedule doesn't seem&nbsp;
to have been affected, and lead animator Nick&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:17.040 --> 00:18:21.680
Kondo confirmed that production had&nbsp;
officially begun in a June 2020 tweet.

00:18:21.680 --> 00:18:24.560
The second of the original&nbsp;
movie's post-credits scenes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:24.560 --> 00:18:27.840
gave fans a major clue about&nbsp;
where the story could be headed,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:27.840 --> 00:18:34.400
introducing viewers to Miguel O'Hara, a.k.a.&nbsp;
Spider-Man 2099. This future version of Spidey,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:34.400 --> 00:18:39.360
voiced by Oscar Isaac, is given a watch that&nbsp;
allows him to travel between dimensions.

00:18:39.360 --> 00:18:41.840
"This could literally not get any weirder."

00:18:41.840 --> 00:18:45.840
Reportedly, the sequel is also set&nbsp;
to feature Japanese Spider-Man,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:45.840 --> 00:18:50.400
while Spider-Man: The Animated Series star&nbsp;
Christopher Daniel Barnes has revealed that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:50.400 --> 00:18:55.280
he would love to play his version of Spider-Man&nbsp;
in the movie. He told Recording Time Media:

00:18:55.280 --> 00:18:57.440
"If I could do that again, I'd be honored."

00:18:57.440 --> 00:19:01.680
Into the Spider-Verse 2 is due&nbsp;
for release on October 7th, 2022.

00:19:02.400 --> 00:19:07.760
Ezra Miller's long-awaited solo outing as&nbsp;
Barry Allen was thrown into peril in 2020,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:07.760 --> 00:19:13.280
when a clip of him appearing to choke a female fan&nbsp;
went viral. Nonetheless, Warner Bros. decided to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:13.280 --> 00:19:19.120
stick by the actor actor, and right now The Flash&nbsp;
remains very much in the pipeline. The project was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:19.120 --> 00:19:25.120
actually given the name Flashpoint back in 2017&nbsp;
— which is also the name of an epic DC event,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:25.120 --> 00:19:30.240
one which saw the Flash turn the whole universe&nbsp;
on its head by traveling backwards in time to save&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:30.240 --> 00:19:35.840
his mother. We don't know how closely director&nbsp;
Andy Muschietti and writer Christina Hodson's film&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:35.840 --> 00:19:40.320
will follow the well-known and beloved arc, but&nbsp;
we do at least know who's going to be in it.

00:19:40.320 --> 00:19:45.840
Barry Allen's mom will be played by Maribel&nbsp;
Verdú, while Ron Livingston will portray his dad,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:45.840 --> 00:19:51.360
having taken over the role from a double-booked&nbsp;
Billy Crudup. According to Variety, Saoirse-Monica&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:51.360 --> 00:19:57.360
Jackson and YouTube star Rudy Mancuso will also&nbsp;
feature. In bigger news, it's been confirmed that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:57.360 --> 00:20:03.440
Sasha Calle has been cast as Supergirl and will be&nbsp;
making her debut alongside the Scarlet Speedster.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:03.440 --> 00:20:08.320
Plus, Ben Affleck will be returning as&nbsp;
Batman, with Muschietti telling Vanity Fair&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:08.320 --> 00:20:12.480
that Affleck is "a very substantial part&nbsp;
of the emotional impact of the movie."

00:20:12.480 --> 00:20:17.520
Muschietti has also said that Michael&nbsp;
Keaton's 1989 Batman would appear in the film,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:17.520 --> 00:20:22.960
playing a "substantial" part in Barry Allen's&nbsp;
tale. However, in March 2021, Keaton himself&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:22.960 --> 00:20:28.400
told Deadline that he was unsure whether or not&nbsp;
he would take up the cowl again. As he explained:

00:20:28.400 --> 00:20:32.160
"I am needing a minute to think about&nbsp;
it because I'm so fortunate and blessed,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:32.160 --> 00:20:35.600
I got so much going on now. I'm&nbsp;
really into work right now."

00:20:35.600 --> 00:20:40.880
With Keaton or without him, The Flash is&nbsp;
scheduled for release on November 4th, 2022.

00:20:41.680 --> 00:20:47.840
Kevin Feige gave away nothing about Captain Marvel&nbsp;
2 when he revealed his MCU Phase 4 plans back in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:47.840 --> 00:20:53.920
2019, but we now know a whole lot more about the&nbsp;
upcoming sequel. Brie Larson will reprise the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:53.920 --> 00:20:59.440
role of Carol Danvers, and she will be facing&nbsp;
off against Velvet Buzzsaw actor Zawe Ashton,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:59.440 --> 00:21:05.040
who, according to Deadline, has been cast as a&nbsp;
thus-far unidentified villain. The same outlet&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:05.040 --> 00:21:10.560
has revealed that Teyonah Parris' Monica Rambeau&nbsp;
will feature, reprising her WandaVision role,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:10.560 --> 00:21:16.240
as will Iman Vellani's Kamala Khan, focus&nbsp;
of the upcoming Disney+ series Ms. Marvel.

00:21:16.240 --> 00:21:20.640
The coronavirus pandemic inevitably slowed&nbsp;
the movie down a little, but production on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:20.640 --> 00:21:26.560
Captain Marvel 2 reportedly began in earnest&nbsp;
in early January 2021. That same month,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:26.560 --> 00:21:30.640
Larson spoke to Lilly Singh about&nbsp;
the hiring of director Nia DaCosta,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:30.640 --> 00:21:35.280
who is set to become the first Black&nbsp;
woman to direct an MCU movie. She said:

00:21:35.280 --> 00:21:39.440
"It's amazing, and I'm so excited that&nbsp;
it's announced and I can talk about it.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:39.440 --> 00:21:43.120
Nia is amazing and she got the job&nbsp;
because she is the best person for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:43.120 --> 00:21:47.840
the job. She just gave an incredible&nbsp;
presentation and I'm inspired by her."

00:21:47.840 --> 00:21:51.440
Captain Marvel 2 will be&nbsp;
released on November 11th, 2022.

00:21:52.400 --> 00:21:57.040
A sequel to 2018's Aquaman seemed&nbsp;
inevitable from the moment James Wan's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:57.040 --> 00:22:02.160
underwater epic dethroned The Dark Knight&nbsp;
Rises as the highest grossing DC movie ever.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:02.160 --> 00:22:07.680
In January 2019, Deadline revealed that Warner&nbsp;
Bros. wanted Wan to oversee development of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:07.680 --> 00:22:12.000
Aquaman 2 and had given the director&nbsp;
permission to select his own writer.

00:22:12.000 --> 00:22:16.880
A few weeks later, The Hollywood Reporter&nbsp;
confirmed that David Leslie Johnson-McGoldrick,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:16.880 --> 00:22:22.000
who co-wrote the original movie, had been&nbsp;
hired for the sequel. And while Aquaman 2&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:22.000 --> 00:22:26.080
will be very much their brainchild, it&nbsp;
seems that Jason Momoa has been chipping&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:26.080 --> 00:22:30.880
in with some ideas, too. In October&nbsp;
2019, he told Entertainment Tonight:

00:22:30.880 --> 00:22:36.320
"[I] went into Warner Bros in D.C. and said,&nbsp;
'You know, I have some ideas.' They love them,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:36.320 --> 00:22:41.280
and James [Wan] and everyone is like, 'We're all&nbsp;
taking it in. We're excited to do another one.'"

00:22:41.280 --> 00:22:43.520
The actor wouldn't get into specifics,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:43.520 --> 00:22:48.720
but he promised that Aquaman 2 was going to be&nbsp;
"way bigger" than the first installment, saying:

00:22:48.720 --> 00:22:53.040
"There's a lot more in store on so many&nbsp;
more levels. There's going to be a lot."

00:22:53.040 --> 00:22:57.200
All we know for sure about the plot of the&nbsp;
sequel is that the titular hero will face&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:57.200 --> 00:23:01.920
off against classic nemesis Black Manta, who&nbsp;
was rescued by an obsessive scientist in the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:01.920 --> 00:23:07.840
first movie's mid-credits scene. Aquaman&nbsp;
2 hits theaters on December 16th, 2022.

00:23:08.160 --> 00:23:13.520
Released in 2019, Shazam! was a major win&nbsp;
for Warner Bros., with the vast majority of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:13.520 --> 00:23:17.840
critics praising the film's departure from&nbsp;
the somber tone that had come to define DC&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:17.840 --> 00:23:21.680
movies. There's nothing official on the&nbsp;
upcoming sequel in terms of plot yet,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:21.680 --> 00:23:27.040
but we do know that director David F. Sandberg&nbsp;
and screenwriter Henry Gayden are both back,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:27.040 --> 00:23:30.160
and all the principal cast members&nbsp;
are expected to return, too.

00:23:30.160 --> 00:23:33.440
But who will the Shazamily be&nbsp;
up against this time out? Well,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:33.440 --> 00:23:38.720
one of the Shazam! post-credit tags introduced&nbsp;
a talking caterpillar-like creature that fans of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:38.720 --> 00:23:45.506
the comics will surely have recognized as Mister&nbsp;
Mind, a traditional adversary of Billy Batson.

00:23:45.506 --> 00:23:51.440
"Oh, what fun we're going to have together.&nbsp;
The seven realms are about to be ours."

00:23:52.080 --> 00:23:57.600
It's also been confirmed that Helen Mirren and&nbsp;
Lucy Liu will play villains by the name of Hespera&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:57.600 --> 00:24:01.760
and Kalypso, respectively. They're&nbsp;
both sisters, original characters,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:01.760 --> 00:24:06.240
and daughters of the god Atlas, whose most&nbsp;
popular run in the comics came under Jack&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:06.240 --> 00:24:12.960
Kirby's stewardship in the mid-'70s. Shazam: Fury&nbsp;
of the Gods will be released on June 2nd, 2023.

